The alarmingly hot dish-pit part 0 is some text that varies. The alarmingly hot dish-pit part 0 is "Well, here we are in an alarmingly hot dish-pit. Let's see what's in here.



There is an exit to the south. Don't worry, it is unblocked.".
The description of r_70 is "[alarmingly hot dish-pit part 0]".

The r_2 is mapped south of r_70.
