The internal name of r_73 is "clean bathroom".
The printed name of r_73 is "-= Clean Bathroom =-".
The clean bathroom part 0 is some text that varies. The clean bathroom part 0 is "You are in a bathroom. A clean one.



There is an unblocked exit to the south.".
The description of r_73 is "[clean bathroom part 0]".

